From: Turner Linux Port <turner@localhost>
Subject: [RFC PATCH] dt-bindings: mailbox: mediatek: describe MT6991 GPUEB

MT6991 uses the same twelve GPUEB mailbox channel IDs, TX/RX layout,
and send/status/acknowledge register offsets as MT8196. Describe the
SoC-specific compatible with the existing controller as fallback.

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/mediatek,mt8196-gpueb-mbox.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/mediatek,mt8196-gpueb-mbox.yaml
@@ -11,8 +11,11 @@
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    enum:
-      - mediatek,mt8196-gpueb-mbox
+    oneOf:
+      - const: mediatek,mt8196-gpueb-mbox
+      - items:
+          - const: mediatek,mt6991-gpueb-mbox
+          - const: mediatek,mt8196-gpueb-mbox
 
   reg:
     items:
